<title>USA: Cooper Life cuts stake in Cooper Companies.</title>
<headline>Cooper Life cuts stake in Cooper Companies.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cooper Life Sciences Inc said Friday it cut its stake in Cooper Cos Inc to 2,192,533 common shares or 18.80 percent of the outstanding.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Cooper Life Sciences said it sold 130,000 common shares between May 30 and August 27 at prices ranging from $12 to $13.625 per share.</p>
</text>
